{"id":24664,"date":"2024-09-23T08:33:10","date_gmt":"2024-09-23T15:33:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/?p=24664"},"modified":"2025-06-09T14:47:30","modified_gmt":"2025-06-09T21:47:30","slug":"pr-digilenshololight","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/pr-digilenshololight\/","title":{"rendered":"DigiLens Helps Transform Enterprises Through 3D Visualization and Real-Time Collaboration Capabilities on ARGO with Hololight"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"24664\" class=\"elementor elementor-24664\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-368d650 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"368d650\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3ec2528\" data-id=\"3ec2528\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b0414a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7b0414a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"431\" src=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/2024-AUG-HL-NVIDIA-HL-Image-03-1800px-768x431.png\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-24665\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/2024-AUG-HL-NVIDIA-HL-Image-03-1800px-768x431.png 768w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/2024-AUG-HL-NVIDIA-HL-Image-03-1800px-300x168.png 300w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/2024-AUG-HL-NVIDIA-HL-Image-03-1800px-1024x574.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/2024-AUG-HL-NVIDIA-HL-Image-03-1800px-1536x861.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/2024-AUG-HL-NVIDIA-HL-Image-03-1800px.png 1800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-105baed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"105baed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">DigiLens Helps Transform Enterprises Through 3D Visualization and Real-Time Collaboration Capabilities on ARGO with Hololight<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fe6035 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3fe6035\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">DigiLens will deliver multimillion polygon models to mobile extended reality (XR) hardware, enabling workers to seamlessly visualize and collaborate in real-time to perform a wide array of tasks, improving efficiency and decision-making. This includes allowing customers to stream Omniverse content and 3D models to ARGO with Hololight streaming, enhancing interactive experiences and operational workflows.<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f3bd1e8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"f3bd1e8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ab34f7b\" data-id=\"ab34f7b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ad14d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9ad14d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Sunnyvale, CA \u2013 September 23, 2024:<\/strong> DigiLens Inc., a leading nanotechnology innovator in waveguide display technologies and XR smartglasses, announced today it is bringing complex, high-fidelity, multimillion polygon models to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/argo\/\">DigiLens ARGO\u2122<\/a> smartglasses in collaboration with Hololight. Transforming how industries engage with 3D content and enabling real-time collaboration on mobile XR hardware will allow workers to shift from workstations to enterprise-grade XR smartglasses, as high-quality 3D assets can now be securely visualized anytime and anywhere, enhancing design and engineering processes. Workers can visualize and collaborate in real-time to perform tasks like reviewing designs, planning factory layouts, assessing risk, quality assurance, and more to improve decision-making.<\/p><p>Most mobile XR devices have only been able to render up to one million polygon models natively and run into issues like overheating and greatly reduced battery life. ARGO\u2019s all-in-one system paired with the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nvidia.com\/en-us\/omniverse\/\">NVIDIA Omniverse<\/a>\u2122 platform and <a href=\"https:\/\/hololight.com\/category\/products\/hololight-space\/\">Hololight Space<\/a> means ARGO can support more robust 3D models \u2014 up to 30M polygons tested so far \u2014 without quickly overheating and draining power. Omniverse, a platform for developing OpenUSD applications for industrial digitalization and generative physical AI, renders the complex models. Hololight Space&#8217;s integrated proprietary streaming technology, Hololight Stream, enables highly secure, high-fidelity visualization without the need for data optimization on ARGO.<\/p><p>&#8220;Our work with DigiLens allows us to push the boundaries of 3D visualization and real-time collaboration. With Hololight Space, users can now securely experience unprecedented high-fidelity 3D content on ARGO, revolutionizing the way industries design, plan, and innovate,\u201d said Florian Haspinger, CEO of Hololight. \u201cARGO&#8217;s all-in-one system and Hololight Space&#8217;s seamless integration with NVIDIA Omniverse will help set a new standard for 3D content management and visualization.&#8221;<\/p><p>ARGO is the first purpose-built, standalone AR\/XR device designed for enterprise and industrial-lite workers. NVIDIA Omniverse enables developers to easily integrate Universal Scene Description (OpenUSD) into existing software tools and allows users to enhance their 3D applications and deploy them anywhere from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nvidia.com\/en-us\/omniverse\/cloud\/\">NVIDIA<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nvidia.com\/en-us\/omniverse\/cloud\/\"> Omniverse Cloud<\/a>. Hololight Space is a leading industrial augmented reality (AR) and virtual reality (VR) software for seamless 3D data visualization.<\/p><p>By offloading the processing to Omniverse and leveraging Hololight Space to visualize and stream high-fidelity 3D content to ARGO effortlessly, users will have a centralized repository for all their assets and can take advantage of the security benefits of not having the content stored locally on the device. Workers can utilize ARGO\u2019s spatial capabilities to walk around, interact with, and view different layers and details of complex digital twin models such as jet engines, machinery, hospital scans, and more.<\/p><p>\u201cHololight\u2019s streaming solution integrated with NVIDIA Omniverse unlocks new possibilities for digital twin models in hyper-scaled environments for many use cases,\u201d said Nima Shams, DigiLens VP and GM of Product Engineering. \u201cUp to now, AR products were rooted for consumer solutions. DigiLens has developed a purpose-built solution platform, tailored for industrial markets, that\u2019s poised to become the primary choice for workers.\u201d<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca4d5ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ca4d5ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>###<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-652d2c3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"652d2c3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-20f1b7c\" data-id=\"20f1b7c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a52c37e elementor-widget elementor-widget-global elementor-global-24667 elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a52c37e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><strong>About DigiLens Inc.<br \/><\/strong>DigiLens is a leader in holographic waveguides used for XR displays. The company has developed a patented optical platform and photopolymer technology that deliver best-in-class solutions using a unique, low-cost contact-copy manufacturing process. DigiLens enables OEM partners to design and build XR-enabled devices for the global automobile, enterprise, consumer, avionics, and defense industries. Based in Sunnyvale, CA, DigiLens\u2019 investors include industry leaders like Samsung Electronics, Samsung Electro-Mechanics, Diamond Edge Ventures, the strategic investment arm of Mitsubishi Chemical Holdings Corporation, Alsop Louie Partners, Optimas Capital Management, 37 Interactive Entertainment, UDC Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Universal Display Corporation, Niantic, Inc., Sony Innovation Fund, Dolby Family Ventures, Continental AG, and more.<\/p><p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><strong>Press Contact<\/strong><br \/>Brian Hamilton<br \/><a href=\"mailto:brian.hamilton@DigiLens.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Brian.Hamilton@DigiLens.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40c8afb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"40c8afb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><strong>About Hololight<br \/><\/strong>Hololight is the leading provider of enterprise augmented and virtual reality (XR) software, infrastructure, and streaming technology. The company&#8217;s Hololight Hub XR streaming platform ensures that the management and deployment of augmented and virtual reality applications is not only secure, but also seamless, regardless of scale. Complemented by proprietary XR streaming technology and an engineering-focused XR application, Hololight enables organizations to drive innovation in product development, manufacturing, training, and more. Founded in 2015, Hololight proudly serves the global market from offices in Germany, Austria, and the United States. Discover Hololight&#8217;s transformative XR solutions at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.hololight.com\">www.hololight.com<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>DigiLens will deliver multimillion polygon models to mobile extended reality (XR) hardware, enabling workers to seamlessly visualize and collaborate in real-time to perform a wide array of tasks, improving efficiency and decision-making. This includes allowing customers to stream Omniverse content and 3D models to ARGO with Hololight streaming, enhancing interactive experiences and operational workflows.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":24665,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_coblocks_attr":"","_coblocks_dimensions":"","_coblocks_responsive_height":"","_coblocks_accordion_ie_support":"","content-type":"","_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","editor_plus_copied_stylings":"{}","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-met